<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman starts Woolwich.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Goldman starts Woolwich.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Woolwich Plc, the former UK building society, which made its market debut on Monday, was rated &quot;market underperformer&quot; as Goldman Sachs started coverage of the banking stock, the investment bank said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available. The stock was down 25p at 309 by 1008 GMT in active trade of just over 12 million shares.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
